":"そしてプリンシパルを終えて、久しぶりにひなちまふぁみりーさんにお会いできて、すっごく楽しかったなあ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事や学校、部活などを頑張っているというふぁみりーさんのお話しを聞くと、ひなも頑張るぞって思えます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまふぁみりーさんから、たくさんの元気と笑顔を頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈もみなさんの癒しになれるように両手を広げて(笑)待ってるので、いつでもひなのもとに来てね...(*˘︶˘*).｡.:*♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっという間の時間..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援して下さるみなさんとふれあえる場所...それは、とても大切なものだなと改めて思ったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん大好きです。♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/06/22/9529739/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、お留守番ふぁみりーさんへ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の4部は、日奈が大好きなお花\nひまわり柄のトップスに、\nハイウエスト短パン♪\nそして髪型は、ハーフツインでひまわりの髪飾りをつけたよ＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/06/22/9529739/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部は、白の半袖ワンピースにショート風の髪型！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めての髪型だったけど、可愛いって言ってもらえて嬉しかった(*´︶`*)\nさくらんぼのイヤリングもつけたよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/06/22/9529739/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エアー握手(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お会いできる日をひなちまってますね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/06/22/9529739/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ショート風のひなだよ♪(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日ね、このブログを書いているとき、おばあちゃんから届いたとっても美味しいみかんを食べていたのだけど...\n眠たすぎて、ウトウトしながら、\nみかんの身ではなく皮を口に運んでいました。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「うんっ！？なんかにがい！？」ってびっくりした(灬ºωº灬)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しっかり体を休めて、今朝はすっきりした気持ちで起きれたよ＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はアンダーライブのリハ☆\n頑張るよん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【6月22日あんりさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【6月24日てらまさん】\n【6月24日Alex san@香港乃木坂ファンさん】\n【6月24日そのかさん】\n【6月24日みーかさん】\n【6月24日youichiさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【6月25日ダイラさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【6月26日にこやんさん】\n【6月26日すずかさん】\n【6月26日ぴーさん】\n【6月26日奈々子さん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆HAPPY  BIRTHDAY☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な一年になります様に♡.。º*＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もみなさんにとって幸せであります様に♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-23858":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n 告知遅くなってしまいすみません！\n \n \n \n BUBKAさんで\n くみちゃんとロングインタビューをしてもらいました！！\n \n \n いっぱい語れて楽しかったな〜〜\n \n \n \n インタビューされるの好きです！\n \n お話しすることが大好きです！\n \n \n \n \n この夏の全国ツアーについていっぱいお話ししたので\n ぜひ見てください！！\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH98CJGN96C4BZEK32H1DTG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-20845":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n こんばんは꒰⑅ᵕ༚ᵕ꒱˖♡\n \n 佐々木美玲です！！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KGXSZN0S66R17M8CTAWHR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 今日はショールーム\n \n 見てくれてありがとうございました！\n \n \n \n \n \n ひらがなけやきの\n \n 誰よりも高く跳べ！\n \n はどうでしたか〜？？？\n \n \n \n \n \n \n ひらがなけやき\n \n 初のミュージックビデオが\n \n YouTubeに載っているので\n \n 是非たくさん見てくださいね꒰●꒡ ̫ ꒡●꒱\n \n \n \n \n \n \n すごくいい曲を\n \n 歌わせて頂けて\n \n 本当に嬉しいです。\n \n \n \n \n 何回も聴いてしまう〜！！\n \n \n \n \n \n めいめいとまなふぃーも今日の\n \n ショールーム、\n \n 行きたかったーってすごい\n \n 言ってました(>人<;)\n \n \n \n \n \n 12人全員揃って\n \n いつかできますように♡♡\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KGYWRMKB95ANY7HVA35T4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n そしてそしてミュージックビデオは\n \n ゆうかとサッカーのユニフォームを\n \n 着ましたʕ•ᴥ•ʔ\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 私、サッカーはしたことないけど\n \n サッカー部のマネージャーは\n \n 少しだけやったことあります(^-^)\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n あんまり役に立って\n \n 無かったけど〜！笑\n \n \n \n \n \n ちらちらとユニフォームで\n \n 踊ってるシーンも写っているので\n \n そこも要チェックです(≧▽≦)\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n あと私のオススメ？というか\n \n お気に入りは\n \n あや(たかもとあやか)の弓道姿と\n \n 笑顔です(*ﾟｰﾟ)v\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 初めてのミュージックビデオ撮影\n \n すごく楽しかったけど、\n \n 初めてのことだらけで\n \n 大変でした(´×ω×`)\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n もっともっとこれから\n \n 漢字欅のように\n \n 成長できたらなと思います！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 漢字欅さんのミュージックビデオも\n \n 初めて見たんですがすごく\n \n かっこよかったです(๑`･ᴗ･´๑)\n \n \n \n \n \n \n YouTubeで今何回も\n \n 見てます( ^_ゝ^)ﾆｯｺﾘ\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 今日はありがとうございました！！\n \n たくさんの方々に見て頂けて\n \n 嬉しかったです(｡･ω･｡)\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KGZW5RGZ5G79NW49B0YQ2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n それじゃあこの辺で！！\n \n 明日東京？か分からないけど\n \n 大雪が降るらしいので\n \n 気をつけてください꒰●꒡ ̫ ꒡●꒱\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n それじゃあびーばい(｡･ω･｡)\n \n \n \n ＊佐々木美玲＊"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-22393":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n こんばんは꒰⑅ᵕ༚ᵕ꒱˖♥\n \n 佐々木美玲です！！！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ11P905NY5PZB3DXWBNZGYE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 明日は名古屋で全国握手会が\n \n あります( ･ㅂ･)و ̑̑\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 今日授業中に考えていたんですけど\n \n 名古屋で一番有名な特産物？\n \n お土産ってなんだろう？？\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n うなぎかな？\n \n くみは手羽先って言ってました！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n お土産買えたら\n \n 買って帰りたいな〜꒰●꒡ ̫ ꒡●꒱\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n お土産の話になっちゃったけど\n \n また話を戻してっと！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 是非、全国握手会来てくださいね♥\n \n 握手会のペアは守屋さんです！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n よろしくお願いします(´｡✪ω✪｡｀)✧*\n \n 待ってます♪\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n それではまた明日。\n \n おやすみなさい〜(^-^)\n \n \n \n \n \n ＊佐々木美玲＊"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-9836":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ遅れちゃってごめんなさいっ＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、悪天候の中、\n会いにきてくださったみなさま\n本当に有難うございました(｡>ω<｡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大変だったよね...ホントにごめんね、(´ ; _ ; ｀)\n大丈夫だったかなぁー(ノω・、)心配です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぞ寒かったでしょう...(´・・｀)\n少しはさゆにゃんのお手てで、\nあったかくなってくれてたら\n嬉しいです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あったまったかなぁ？(  *^_^*  )照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしは、みなさんとお話できて\nとーっても嬉しかったし、楽しかったです！\n寒さもふきとんじゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、大好きなドーナツを食べたので\n元気100倍でした！＼(^o^)／笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好物のエサを与えられると\n元気になる単純な私..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペットボトルの飲み物を飲みきって、\n達成感にひたる嬉しそうなにゃんさゆ。\n片手にはドーナツ（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、金運一位おめでとう～！って\n言ってくれてありがとうー(丿^ω^ヽ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなにも、ぎゅぅーってして\n金運、伝えたよっｐ(*^-^*)ｑ 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、お出かけするときは、\nお買い物じゃなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花や芸術が好きだから、\n庭園とか美術館にしか行かないの。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういうとこでほっこりしてる\nゆっくりな時間が好き  ♪♪\nあとは、空とかがすっごく好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういうものに、何よりも、\n価値を感じます(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"物を大切にしたいから新しい物も\nぽんぽん買おうとしなくて\n物欲もあんまりないんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キレイなお花とか木とか\n空とか景色とか空気なら\nこの世界にたくさんほしい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だれかお願いします(>_<)\nゴセイナイトぉぉお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪の写真とか、私服とかは\nまた別でのっけるね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若様ー(*pωq*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゅんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんてこったあ！\nかっこよすぎふっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかさまーーー(｀・д´・)ぅぉぉおおお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新成人のみなさん、おめでとうございます ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんが幸せでありますようにっ*:･"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりん、みさみさ、まいやん、ななみんも、おめでとー＼(^o^)／\n４人とも本当にダイスキ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会が終わったあと、\nケーキでお祝いしました꒰๑͒•௰•๑͒꒱"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いよいよ4人も、大人の仲間入りだねっ(｡>ω<｡)\n新しい世界が開けますよーに♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お父さん、お母さんへ感謝の気持ちを\n忘れることなく、大きく飛躍される\nことを祈っています"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0017.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-7063":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/08/8162898/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/08/8162898/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは！(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/08/8162898/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴんく色のお花すき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公演、見にきて下さった皆さん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難うございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/08/8162898/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/08/8162898/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、８位に選んで頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に嬉しいです。**"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難うございます！前屈土下座ッ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、、実は一昨日の２幕に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の姿はありませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自信がなくて、舞台に立つのがこわくなって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自己紹介も特技披露すらできず、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全く自分をアピールできずに終わってしまって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台上で出してはいけない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分のリアルを出してしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、それを皆さんが客観的に評価してくれて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと甘やかさず私をみてくださって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直...ホッとしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中途半端に残るよりも良かった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ちてみて、見えた光景が沢山ありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台袖から自分たちのステージを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見ることが出来て、勉強になったし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージに出れない経験をして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーメンバーで乃木どこにも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出れなかったあの頃の気持ちを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思い出しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初心に帰ることができて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういう機会を与えてくれた皆さんに感謝です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"投票してくださった人には、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に有難うだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"投票しなかった人の中にもちゃんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のことを考えて、評価してくれて、しなかった人もいただろうから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"投票してくれた人も、してくれなかった人にも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難うって言いたいです＾＾＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういうわけで一昨日は、自分らしさを出せずに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"申し訳ない思いと、悲しい思いをしたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、もうスッキリした気持ちで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思いきり自分らしさを出せました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで自信がなくて臆病になってしまっていたけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんがちゃんと受け止めてくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったです(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は今を生きていて、ここに存在していて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何が出来て、今何を伝えたいのかって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと思いっきり、素直に、表現できるように..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張りたいです！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/08/8162898/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/08/8162898/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...けど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな私を支えてくれて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難うっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/08/8162898/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/08/8162898/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/08/8162898/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルゼンチン！ぺそぺそッ！∧( 'Θ' )∧"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーいわーい ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/08/8162898/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/08/8162898/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/08/8162898/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/08/8162898/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/08/8162898/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-41502":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n こんにちは‪(*´꒳​`*)\n \n 佐々木のみーぱんです！！！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3V3QAW4R4HKVM2G9VS5R5N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 昨日発売の週刊少年サンデーさんの表紙をさせて頂きました😊\n \n みなさんもうゲットしてくれましたか？？\n \n \n \n \n 私はゲット致しました😆😆\n \n この前告知の時に、オフショットを載せると言っていたのでたくさん載せていきますね〜！！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3V3RD0F8CJ4HR44D1TB99E","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3V3SF9E9CJC6385VNTGC97","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3V3TJXGXAJZ3SV7Q8FMQQ4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3V3VP8S60WDSCEKZVVRWJ6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3V3WPACJA01VGC8ZY8T57D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 盛りだくさんです😌\n \n マネージャーさんが撮ってくれました📸\n \n \n \n \n \n ぜひコンビニで見かけたら、是非ゲットしてくださいね〜！！\n \n \n \n \n 🍞佐々木美玲🍞"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-3684":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわかつき(｀_´)ゞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント反映されたので\nまた次くらいには\n鬼質問返しやります♪(/ω＼*)\nいっぱい質問嬉しすぎて\nまたまた皆さんが好きになったなんて言ってやらないんだからっ!うそ、嬉しかった(*´ー｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ、デレつきで始まりましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさの記事を\n見ました？(笑)\n若月と衛藤が素敵なことに\nなってます(σ*´∀｀)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"て言うわけで、\n始まりました若月ブログ(σ・∀・)σ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん 今日はいかがですか？\n体調とか崩してないですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"24日は個別握手会ですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"な、なんとまぁ、今回は私服♪\nというわけで制服姿とは\n少し違ったメンバーをお楽しみに♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと少しだぁ(゜Д゜；≡；゜Д゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもは短くて出来ない\nいろんなお話を沢山しましょうね！私のことを沢山知ってもらうことももちろんですが、皆さんのことも教えてほしいです(*´д｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー全員お見立て会以外\n初の個別握手なんで\n緊張してますが、すっごくすっごく楽しみにしてるんで\n皆さんも楽しみにしていてください(o・ω・o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話は変わりますが、\n岩瀬ねぇさん(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつまで\nタイトルを続けるつもりだ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月は知っている。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"岩瀬佑美子......お主には\n携帯という別途の機器が\nあるということを。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず皆さん、\n個別握手会で岩瀬さんを\n問い詰めてみてください(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして安藤さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おばぁちゃまの煮物を\nタッパに容れて\n撮影に持ってくる姿...すきよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"par